<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Course Enrollment Confirmation</title>
</head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f4f4;">
    <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 20px;">
        <!-- Header -->
        <div style="text-align: center; padding: 20px 0; border-bottom: 2px solid #6f42c1;">
            <h1 style="color: #6f42c1; margin: 0; font-size: 28px;">🎓 Course Enrollment</h1>
            <p style="color: #666; margin: 5px 0 0 0;">Uplift Community Platform</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Main Content -->
        <div style="padding: 30px 0;">
            <h2 style="color: #333; margin-bottom: 20px;">Congratulations {{userName}}! 🎉</h2>
            
            <p style="color: #666; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                You have successfully enrolled in <strong>{{courseName}}</strong>! 
                We're excited to support you on your learning journey.
            </p>

            <div style="background-color: #f8f9fa; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 20px 0; border-left: 4px solid #6f42c1;">
                <h3 style="color: #333; margin-top: 0;">Course Details:</h3>
                <p style="color: #666; margin: 5px 0;"><strong>Course:</strong> {{courseName}}</p>
                <p style="color: #666; margin: 5px 0;"><strong>Instructor:</strong> {{instructorName}}</p>
                <p style="color: #666; margin: 5px 0;"><strong>Enrollment Date:</strong> {{enrollmentDate}}</p>
            </div>

            <div style="background-color: #e7f3ff; padding: 15px; border-radius: 5px; margin: 20px 0;">
                <h4 style="color: #0066cc; margin-top: 0;">What's Next?</h4>
                <ul style="color: #666; margin: 0; padding-left: 20px;">
                    <li>Access your course materials anytime</li>
                    <li>Complete lessons at your own pace</li>
                    <li>Interact with your instructor and fellow students</li>
                    <li>Earn a certificate upon completion</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
                <a href="{{dashboardUrl}}" style="background-color: #6f42c1; color: white; padding: 15px 30px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block;">
                    Start Learning Now
                </a>
            </div>

            <div style="background-color: #f8f9fa; padding: 15px; border-radius: 5px; margin: 20px 0;">
                <h4 style="color: #333; margin-top: 0;">Learning Tips:</h4>
                <ul style="color: #666; margin: 0; padding-left: 20px;">
                    <li>Set aside regular time for studying</li>
                    <li>Take notes and practice what you learn</li>
                    <li>Don't hesitate to ask questions</li>
                    <li>Connect with other learners</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <p style="color: #666; line-height: 1.6;">
                If you have any questions about the course or need technical support, 
                feel free to reach out to us. We're here to help you succeed!
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <div style="border-top: 1px solid #eee; padding-top: 20px; text-align: center;">
            <p style="color: #999; font-size: 14px; margin: 0;">
                This email was sent from Uplift Community Platform<br>
                Need help? Contact us at <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}" style="color: #007bff;">{{supportEmail}}</a>
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>